<title>USA: Dakota Mining Corp 1996 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Dakota Mining Corp 1996 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		    $0.73     loss	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net loss		   23,000     loss	 9,000</p>
<p> Revs			 24,600		   17,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 loss includes $16.4 million in non-recurring expense for writedown, cost accruals, depletion accounting charge, expensing of previously deferred costs and mine start-up expenses.</p>
